          <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-f218494243204ac5952912fa3cb6415b" textAlignment="1">
            <bounds x="6792" y="876" width="264" height="88"/>
            <sourceConnection id="id-eb8ac205f45543b1882ba3c7ea521f5b" source="id-f218494243204ac5952912fa3cb6415b" target="id-ecd4067385804c1a8b0f9b9b778856d8"/>
            <content>Toewijzen van capaciteit voor beoordeling. Zodat er capaciteit beschikbaar is omtrend processtap &quot;beoordelen examen&quot;.</content>
